  "description": "The purpose of the 2007-2018 jeep wrangler JK front bumper,with Winch Plate Mounting & 2 x D-Rings is to reduce or prevent physical damage to the front of vehicles in low-speed crashes. The off-road bumper is designed to protect the hood, trunk, grille, fuel, exhaust, and cooling system. The front bumper is made of steel and aluminum. It absorbs shocks from car accidents.\nFeatures\nPrevent scrapes and dents. The best bumper guard will protect your vehicle from getting dented, scraped, or scratched by another vehicle when you or someone else is parking. They also have impact absorption qualities.\nPark worry-free. If you are parking challenged or are afraid someone else will inadvertently hit your vehicle in a parking lot or on the street, a front bumper guard will give you peace of mind.\nSave money. Repairing a beat-up bumper can be costly. Avoid expensive repairs by investing in a full bumper protector.\nMaintain your vehicle’s resale value. If you eventually decide to sell your car, it will be worth more if the bumper is in good shape than if it’s marked up with dings and dents.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation recommended.\nFitment\nFits for 2007-2018 Jeep Wrangler JK & JK Unlimited 2-Door & 4-Door All Models.\nNote: The shackle is not designed for towing and recovery, refer to the owner's manual for towing and rescue information. Overload is not included in after-sales service.",
